      "writtenOn": "2025-10-23T19:59:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there any precedent for dm targets putting sysfs files in the block sysfs directory like this?  There are several issues with doing it that way.  It looks like the usual pattern for returning stats from dm targets is to use STATUSTYPE_INFO.  Check out dm-delay.c, dm-era-target.c, dm-integrity.c, etc.",
