      "writtenOn": "2025-10-28T17:05:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for this constructive feedback. I did not find an example of dm targets putting files in /sys/block. STATUSTYPE_INFO is being used for exposing the runtime information. Few examples of dm targets exposing counter via STATUSTYPE_INFO:\ndm-integrity --\u003e the number of integrity mismatches, etc\ndm-era --\u003e  current era\nI have updated the verity-fec to do similar.",
